WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.860 --> 00:00:10.040
If your school uses Microsoft accounts, you can sign in to Fixer Nation with yours. This video shows how, and what to expect the first time.

2
00:00:10.541 --> 00:00:20.011
On the public site, when a page asks you to log in, select Log in. In the window that opens, you'll see a button that says Continue with Microsoft.

3
00:00:20.513 --> 00:00:31.613
Select it, and you're taken to Microsoft's own page to sign in with your school account. This video doesn't show that page. Fixer Nation never sees your Microsoft password.

4
00:00:32.116 --> 00:00:35.496
When you come back, the page tells you to check your email.

5
00:00:35.997 --> 00:00:43.677
The first time you use it, we send you one email, to make sure the mailbox is really yours. Open it, and select the link.

6
00:00:44.180 --> 00:00:54.170
You'll land on a page that asks you to confirm. Read it, and select Confirm. If you didn't start this sign-in, just close the page, and nothing is connected.

7
00:00:54.672 --> 00:01:00.662
You're signed in, and the page takes you back to where you were headed. Here, that's your classrooms.

8
00:01:01.164 --> 00:01:15.084
Next time, you can skip the email. Just select Log In, then Continue with Microsoft, and sign in on Microsoft's page. The School Admin and District Admin sign-in pages use email and password only.
